OL,5,G0105 Shop on TV
OL,6,G0300 The Chase Around the World
OL,7,     FThe teams land in Barcelona to
OL,8,     Ftake on the Vixen and the Menace,
OL,9,     Fwho have set a series of quiz
OL,10,     Fquestions that the teams must
OL,11,     Fsolve to navigate across the city
OL,12,     Fand find Bradley Walsh at the
OL,13,     Ffinish line. Competition is fierce
OL,14,     Fas teams do not want to finish
OL,15,     Flast. If they do they face a
OL,16,     Fhead-to-head showdown with the
OL,17,     FChasers. The final pair will need
OL,18,     Fto beat them to join the other
OL,19,     Fteams and head onto the next city.
OL,20,     FLose and it's the first flight
OL,21,     Fhome
